# Pane plan for scripts/launch/panes.sh (project-owned).
# <column>|<title>|<command>   column: L or R. Empty command = a prepared shell.
# Number the titles in start order; the command is pre-filled, Enter runs it.
L|1 System bringup|ros2 launch <system>_bringup system.launch.py sim_gazebo:=true
L|3 RViz|ros2 launch <system>_bringup rviz.launch.py
L|Scratch|
R|2 Capabilities|ros2 launch <capability>_bringup <capability>.launch.py
R|4 Orchestrator|ros2 launch <system>_orchestrator orchestrator.launch.py
R|Monitor|ros2 topic list
